{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01RbxKUWGE5wpVsnxzHMcK8w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_vrtx_01WAkDsCfpsuZaSHPyQNSyRF","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add ai-engineering/answers/03-006-essential-components-of-an-agent-beyond-an-llm.md ai-engineering/plan.md ai-engineering/progress.txt && git commit -m \"feat(ai-eng): 03-agents-tool-use — Q6: essential components of an agent beyond an LLM\n\nFour-component architecture: tool layer (JSON-schemed actuators, schema quality),\nmemory (working/episodic/semantic/procedural types), orchestrator (turn budget,\nretry, HITL, checkpointing), observability/safety (LangSmith, Presidio, allowlist).\nIncludes LangGraph support-agent stack and failure-mode table.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\"","description":"Commit Q6 answer note and plan updates"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":243,"cache_read_input_tokens":65122,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":243,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":19},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c6a5410-8272-4608-870e-772871015af8","uuid":"4c515e3a-7f3a-4ba3-b995-c7ba03c01ea0"}
